    "created_at": "2021-01-16T06:32:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-01-16T06:32:56Z",
    "body": "Exit code 35 indicates that curl was unable to establish an SSL handshake with the remote (in this case, GitHub).\r\n\r\nYour system seems to think it's September 24, 2018, and SSL handshakes do often fail when clocks are out of sync (especially to GitHub, which replaced some of its SSL infrastructure last year to deprecate TLS 1.0). Can you try updating your system clock and rerunning the script?",
